      "value": "Hello.\n\nWe have prepared an avatar for you. https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_130ae8ce-6e55-4cd6-8c76-de4c9fd6cfa5\n\nWhen I prepared my avatar and had my friends test it, different things happened.\n\nSince it is very confusing, I have made the videos and notes of the verification results, as well as the assets of the particles used, available for download.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HBj9hEP1DFXnb7DMJUyBexB5MRRB9Xtd?usp=sharing",
